/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012820/extras/3e7267f4e366ace943eff165c0522b27.poster.avif?t=1739039634\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012820/extras/3e7267f4e366ace943eff165c0522b27.webm?t=1739039634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012820/extras/3e7267f4e366ace943eff165c0522b27.mp4?t=1739039634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If seen, run.</p>",
